# Project context

Healthcare Operations Management System (UI brand: **HealthOps**).

## Structure

- `frontend/` — React SPA (Vite), role-based routes and portals
- `backend/` — Express API, Zod validators, Prisma ORM, PostgreSQL
- `docs/` — product roadmap, API inventory, testing guide, OpenAPI

## Major business modules (existing)

- **Auth / security** — register, login, JWT, password reset/change, account lockout
- **Users** — admin user management; roles in schema include ADMIN, DOCTOR, PHARMACIST, PATIENT, SUPPORT, VIEWER
- **Patients** — records, deactivate, dependents, emergency contact, documents, medical profile
- **Doctors** — provider registry with status (including ON_LEAVE)
- **Appointments** — admin create; status lifecycle with overlap checks; patient history is view-only in the portal
- **Prescriptions** — create with items; statuses ACTIVE / COMPLETED / CANCELLED
- **Orders / payments** — order lifecycle and payment status; patient pay/track UI
- **Pharmacy workspace** — pharmacist lookup of patient prescriptions/orders and status updates
- **Patient portal** — profile, appointments (view), orders, tracking, payment flows

## Authorization notes

- Backend `authenticate` / `authorize` / patient-access checks are the security boundary
- SUPPORT and VIEWER exist in `UserRole`; many routes do not currently authorize them

